---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const description = 'Practice coding, system design, behavioral questions, and other interview formats across 41 companies.';
---

<Base title="Interview Notebook" description={description}>
  <article class="container page-shell">
    <a class="text-link" href="/projects/">← All projects</a>
    <h1 class="page-title">Interview Notebook.</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">{description}</p>
    <a class="button primary" href="/projects/interview-notebook/lab/">Open Interview Notebook →</a>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="practice-bank">
      <h2 id="practice-bank">The practice bank</h2>
      <p>Choose a company and interview category, or save a shortlist of companies in this browser. The tracker includes 344 exercises with follow-up questions and scoring guides. Each company has two independent exercises in each of four categories. Another 16 exercises draw on published employer examples.</p>
      <p>Open a company page or guide on PracHub from the tracker for more practice. Use Practice to search titles and switch between variants. Export a coverage snapshot or a Codex alert from the tracker. Titles you add are stored in this browser.</p>
      <p>The original Airbnb preparation page cited by two exercises is currently unavailable.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>
